{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design", "label": "Setup-tab Vehicle-Parameter Editor - Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_full_parameter_editor", "label": "Full vehicle-parameter editor (110 params)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Expands the Setup tab from 7 hardcoded tunables to every override vehParams accepts (51 primaries + 59 Pacejka 5.2 coefficients) in collapsible sections with reset, save/load presets, changed-from-default highlighting and tooltips/units; values flow through the existing vp_overrides path so no solve capability changes."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_two_field_kinds", "label": "Two field kinds: spin vs sci", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A QDoubleSpinBox stores its value rounded to its decimals setting, so it cannot represent tiny tyre coefficients (rHy1=-9.1492e-11, rVy5=-8.8234e-11, pHy2=0.00051596) or the 1e-6 epsilons - loading them would silently collapse to 0, corrupting the tyre model and producing a bogus changed-from-default diff. ParamMeta.kind selects QDoubleSpinBox ('spin') for well-scaled primaries and ScientificField ('sci', QLineEdit + ScientificNotation validator, '%.12g') for all MF_KEYS and eps_* keys; both share value()/setValue()/valueChanged."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_vp_dict_model", "label": "RunConfig vp dict (single source of truth)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Migrate the 7 named RunConfig fields into one vp dict seeded from all_vp_defaults(); TIER1_FIELDS and the named fields are removed. No persistence stored top-level brkB-style keys, so only test_runconfig.py needed rewriting."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_diff_from_default_overrides", "label": "Diff-from-default override emission (expert < GUI)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "vp_overrides() loads the expert file as the base layer, then adds only vp entries that differ from all_vp_defaults(); with the GUI at defaults the diff is empty so expert values pass through unchanged, while a GUI edit overrides the expert's value."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_user_presets_dir", "label": "Writable user presets dir", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The bundled app/presets/ is read-only inside sys._MEIPASS when frozen, so user-saved presets go to ~/Documents/FullModelSim/presets/ (created on demand); loading reads from both directories."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_solver_collocation_options", "label": "Solver & collocation options (max_iter, OPT_ds, OPT_d, OPT_e, tol)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five knobs previously hardcoded in userOpts are exposed on the Advanced tab as top-level RunConfig/cfg.json fields (not vp_overrides) and plumbed as userOpts kwargs with identical defaults (6000, 30, 3, 1e-2, 1e-4); they apply to both the 7-state warm start and the 23-state solve. OPT_uinter and other IPOPT options stay hardcoded."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_param_groups_invariant", "label": "PARAM_GROUPS covers PRIMARY_KEYS u MF_KEYS exactly", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The ordered (section, keys) registry must cover the override key set exactly once; a test enforces it so a parameter later added to vehParams without a group fails loudly instead of being silently omitted from the editor."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_changed_from_default_highlight", "label": "Changed-from-default highlighting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Driven purely by current value vs default so it stays correct after any reset, preset load or expert-file load; each field's valueChanged re-evaluates the bold/coloured style and the owning section's '(N changed)' badge; mirrors exactly what vp_overrides() will send."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_override_key_set", "label": "Override key set PRIMARY_KEYS u MF_KEYS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "frozensets of default_primaries() and _default_mf() names; every vehParams override key (presets, expert files, GUI) is validated against their union and an unknown key raises ValueError rather than being silently ignored."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design_cd_cl_overwritten_tooltip", "label": "Cd/Cl overwritten by DATA_AA.mat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cd and Cl are overwritten from Data/DATA_AA.mat at solve time when present, so editing them usually has no effect; surfaced via tooltip only, no special-casing."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design", "target": "app_vp_params_parammeta", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design", "target": "app_vp_params_meta_for", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design", "target": "app_vp_params_all_vp_defaults", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-25-setup-tab-vehicle-params-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_25_setup_tab_vehicle_params_design", "target